    "detailed_description": "<strong>Mini golf with a twist.</strong><br><br>Once an average golf ball, you seem to have surprisingly sprouted legs. Solve golf-themed puzzles by running, jumping, and putting around the map.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508410/extras/27b142e26b9e174d1e6f712352de7a7e.poster.avif?t=1695610611\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508410/extras/27b142e26b9e174d1e6f712352de7a7e.webm?t=1695610611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508410/extras/27b142e26b9e174d1e6f712352de7a7e.mp4?t=1695610611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore multiple worlds, using your understanding of various physics objects to manipulate levels and reach the goal.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508410/extras/d99e46ff6016fe4cd39cb01170bf9d64.poster.avif?t=1695610611\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508410/extras/d99e46ff6016fe4cd39cb01170bf9d64.webm?t=1695610611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508410/extras/d99e46ff6016fe4cd39cb01170bf9d64.mp4?t=1695610611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Express yourself with unique hats and items!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508410/extras/4eea6f30cd52b96729828a8e4ecb3932.poster.avif?t=1695610611\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508410/extras/4eea6f30cd52b96729828a8e4ecb3932.webm?t=169561061